   * - 1-D
     - True
     - ``sorted_sequence[i-1] <= values[m][n]...[l][x] < sorted_sequence[i]``
   * - N-D
     - False
     - ``sorted_sequence[m][n]...[l][i-1] < values[m][n]...[l][x] <= sorted_sequence[m][n]...[l][i]``
   * - N-D
     - True
     - ``sorted_sequence[m][n]...[l][i-1] <= values[m][n]...[l][x] < sorted_sequence[m][n]...[l][i]``

